{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1340576-fire-touched-and-subterfuge","id":1340576,"title":"Fire-Touched and Subterfuge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-10T00:42:00-07:00","id":1340576,"title":"Fire-Touched and Subterfuge","content":"This was probably raised before but I couldn't find any threads for it. <br /> <br /> So, the Ban of the Fire-Touched states they cannot let &quot;falsehoods&quot; lay and that they hate deception. I've read elsewhere that they are forbidden to lie and cannot even hear a lie being spoken without retort. <br /> <br /> ...One of their Tribe Skills is Subterfuge. How does this sit with... Everything?<br /> <br /> And, uh... just in general - <i>what.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T00:58:08-07:00","id":1340577,"title":"","content":"Subterfuge doubles with Empathy as the Skill for spotting lies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T01:39:16-07:00","id":1340583,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s also the skill for not lying while avoiding giving away bits of the truth you\u2019d rather not share.<br /> <br /> Edit to add: And doing it in such a way that those you\u2019re talking to don\u2019t think to ask the right follow-on questions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","user":"Bunyip","date":". 10-10-2019, 04:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T14:12:32-07:00","id":1340681,"title":"","content":"In short, Subterfuge isn't the Lying Skill, It's the Control Information and Perception Skill. The &quot;Look Here, Not There&quot; Skill as much as the &quot;There's Nothing There&quot; Skill.<br /> <br /> Controlling information and how it's perceived is a very useful skill for building and weaponizing the faith of packs, both your own and others, and the masses in general. Faith can be such a delicate thing when it's growing, after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T08:44:06-07:00","id":1340783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1340576-fire-touched-and-subterfuge?p=1340583#post1340583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It\u2019s also the skill for not lying while avoiding giving away bits of the truth you\u2019d rather not share.<br /> <br /> Edit to add: And doing it in such a way that those you\u2019re talking to don\u2019t think to ask the right follow-on questions.</div> </div> </div> </div>While that is lying through omission and therefore violates the ban, I imagine that the self flangellation that comes later is considered acceptable punishment, and is probably the least torturous due to protecting the tribe\u2019s business.<br /> <br /> But yeah, I see it as more of the detection of falsehoods and perceptiveness regarding a person\u2019s behavior when they have something to hide; as is generally agreed upon by these fine folks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}